      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.32,
          "end": 4,
          "en": "Now as a first step",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4,
          "end": 6.93,
          "en": "before we upload anything anywhere,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.93,
          "end": 10.63,
          "en": "we wanna finalize our code, we wanna polish our code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.63,
          "end": 13.33,
          "en": "and make sure it's optimized.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 13.33,
          "end": 16.24,
          "en": "That of course means that we wanna test it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.24,
          "end": 18.67,
          "en": "we wanna test different scenarios",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 18.67,
          "end": 22.73,
          "en": "and find possible errors in the code and fix them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.73,
          "end": 26.38,
          "en": "We also might wanna consider refactoring our code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.38,
          "end": 29.33,
          "en": "so that we don't repeat ourselves too often,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.33,
          "end": 33.29,
          "en": "or that we solve a certain problem with less code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.29,
          "end": 35.55,
          "en": "because the less code you have,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.55,
          "end": 38.92,
          "en": "the less code the users of your website have to download",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 38.92,
          "end": 41.02,
          "en": "before they see something on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.02,
          "end": 44.42,
          "en": "so less code means faster websites.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.42,
          "end": 47.49,
          "en": "And there's one specific optimization technique",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.49,
          "end": 49.44,
          "en": "which I wanna take a closer look at,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.44,
          "end": 53.12,
          "en": "and that would be asynchronous components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 53.12,
          "end": 55.27,
          "en": "which are supported by Vue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.27,
          "end": 58.66,
          "en": "Now, what is that, what are asynchronous components?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.66,
          "end": 60.33,
          "en": "I'm taking this course project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.33,
          "end": 62.65,
          "en": "which we built earlier in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 62.65,
          "end": 65.58,
          "en": "and you'll find that code snapshot attached",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.58,
          "end": 68.33,
          "en": "in case you don't have that at hand.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 68.33,
          "end": 72.05,
          "en": "Here, we have a bunch of components, a couple of components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 72.05,
          "end": 75.22,
          "en": "which we load as pages through the Vue router,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 75.22,
          "end": 77.07,
          "en": "and a bunch of code in general.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 77.07,
          "end": 78.89,
          "en": "Now we can definitely test this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.89,
          "end": 81.33,
          "en": "and we can definitely refactor some code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 81.33,
          "end": 83.97,
          "en": "but that's not what I wanna focus on here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 83.97,
          "end": 87.68,
          "en": "Instead of wanna focus on that async component approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 87.68,
          "end": 89.56,
          "en": "What do I mean with that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.56,
          "end": 91.24,
          "en": "Well, there are certain components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.24,
          "end": 94.863,
          "en": "which we don't need every time this application is loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 95.71000000000001,
          "end": 100.58,
          "en": "A good example could be that dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.58,
          "end": 102.72999999999999,
          "en": "which we see here during login.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 102.72999999999999,
          "end": 106.61,
          "en": "When we log in, we need it, but in the rest of this app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 106.61,
          "end": 108.78,
          "en": "we don't use it too often,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 108.78,
          "end": 112.67,
          "en": "so we might not always need the dialogue component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 112.67,
          "end": 114.75,
          "en": "And the implication of that is that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 114.75,
          "end": 118.72,
          "en": "we don't necessarily need to download the source code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 118.72,
          "end": 121.26,
          "en": "behind that component all the time,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.26,
          "end": 125.2,
          "en": "because as I mentioned, if users visiting this webpage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 125.2,
          "end": 127.49,
          "en": "have to download less code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.49,
          "end": 130.01,
          "en": "that means the website can be used earlier,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 130.01,
          "end": 133.53,
          "en": "you don't have to wait for as much code to download.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 133.53,
          "end": 135.91,
          "en": "So the dialogue could be a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.91,
          "end": 139.57,
          "en": "which we can load lazily, asynchronously,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 139.57,
          "end": 142.63,
          "en": "only when we need it and not in advance,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 142.63,
          "end": 145.46,
          "en": "because right now, all those components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 145.46,
          "end": 149.19,
          "en": "all pages and all other components are downloaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 149.19,
          "end": 153.49,
          "en": "all the time, no matter if a user needs them or not,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.49,
          "end": 155.39,
          "en": "and that means we have everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 155.39,
          "end": 157.61,
          "en": "available when we need it, that's great,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 157.61,
          "end": 161.48,
          "en": "but it also means we download a lot of code in advance,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 161.48,
          "end": 165.47,
          "en": "which we don't need yet, or which we might never need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 165.47,
          "end": 168.91,
          "en": "And a similar example could be found for many routes here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 168.91,
          "end": 173.25,
          "en": "the register as coach route, for example, for this user,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 173.25,
          "end": 176.67000000000002,
          "en": "since I already am a coach, I can't even visit it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 176.67000000000002,
          "end": 178.87,
          "en": "so I definitely don't need to code for that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.77,
          "end": 182.49,
          "en": "And that is something where Vue can help us,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.49,
          "end": 184.8,
          "en": "and let's start with that base dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 184.8,
          "end": 186.473,
          "en": "which we don't need all the time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 187.76,
          "end": 191.62,
          "en": "In main.js, we register this base dialogue.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 191.62,
          "end": 194.1,
          "en": "We import base dialogue from this file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 194.1,
          "end": 195.86,
          "en": "and we then register it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195.86,
          "end": 198.66,
          "en": "Whenever you have an import statement like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 198.66,
          "end": 201.28,
          "en": "this in the end tells Vue that the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 201.28,
          "end": 204.35,
          "en": "in that file you're importing is needed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 204.35,
          "end": 208.17000000000002,
          "en": "and you can imagine that all these imports are in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 208.17000000000002,
          "end": 212.46,
          "en": "when you build your project, when you finalize your project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.46,
          "end": 215,
          "en": "all these imported files are basically merged",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 215,
          "end": 218.633,
          "en": "into one big file, kind of, that's how you can imagine this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.64,
          "end": 222.99,
          "en": "So therefore it would be great if we wouldn't import this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.99,
          "end": 225.81,
          "en": "if we would only import it when we need it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 225.81,
          "end": 228.85,
          "en": "then it would not be merged into this big file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 228.85,
          "end": 231.15,
          "en": "but instead Vue would try to download",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.15,
          "end": 234.35,
          "en": "the required code only when it's needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 234.35,
          "end": 237.06,
          "en": "And for that, Vue has a function we can use,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 237.06,
          "end": 240.173,
          "en": "the defineAsyncComponent function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 241.48,
          "end": 244.13,
          "en": "With that, we can define a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.13,
          "end": 247.623,
          "en": "which is loaded asynchronously, only when it's needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 248.66,
          "end": 252.66,
          "en": "Here, we could then create a constant named base dialogue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 252.66,
          "end": 255.65,
          "en": "so that I don't have to change the name down there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 255.65,
          "end": 258.15,
          "en": "and the value I store in there is the result",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 258.15,
          "end": 260.623,
          "en": "of calling defineAsyncComponent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 261.538,
          "end": 265.62,
          "en": "defineAsyncComponent wants a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 265.62,
          "end": 267.793,
          "en": "and here I'm using an arrow function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 268.88,
          "end": 270.76,
          "en": "It wants a function that in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 270.76,
          "end": 273.71,
          "en": "then returns the imported component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 273.71,
          "end": 276,
          "en": "but Vue will only call that function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 276,
          "end": 278.31,
          "en": "when the component is really needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 278.31,
          "end": 280.7,
          "en": "So here I can use the shorthand notation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 280.7,
          "end": 284.52,
          "en": "of arrow functions and call import,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 284.52,
          "end": 288.98,
          "en": "which also exists as a function like this in JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 288.98,
          "end": 291.25,
          "en": "So it's not the import statement we have here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 291.25,
          "end": 294.6,
          "en": "instead now I call import as a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 294.6,
          "end": 297.40999999999997,
          "en": "And when we call import as a function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 297.40999999999997,
          "end": 300.18,
          "en": "that will only do that import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 300.18,
          "end": 302.31,
          "en": "when the surrounding code executes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 302.31,
          "end": 304.15,
          "en": "which in this case, it's this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 304.15,
          "end": 307.33,
          "en": "we pass to defineAsyncComponent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 307.33,
          "end": 310.81,
          "en": "Well, and this function is executed by Vue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 310.81,
          "end": 314.91,
          "en": "only when that component is used, when it's needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 314.91,
          "end": 316.74,
          "en": "And with that, we ensure that the code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 316.74,
          "end": 319.03,
          "en": "of the entire base dialogue component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 319.03,
          "end": 320.633,
          "en": "is only imported when needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 321.59,
          "end": 324.96,
          "en": "Now for that, we still need to provide a path",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 324.96,
          "end": 328.52,
          "en": "to that component here to import though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 328.52,
          "end": 330.74,
          "en": "but now with this dynamic import,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 330.74,
          "end": 335.48,
          "en": "we don't import it in advance, but only when it's required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 335.48,
          "end": 337.58,
          "en": "And now we can still assign base dialogue",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 337.58,
          "end": 340.64,
          "en": "as a component here for base dialogue,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 340.64,
          "end": 343.19,
          "en": "and Vue will know how to handle that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 343.19,
          "end": 345.883,
          "en": "when it needs to bring a dialogue to the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 347.29,
          "end": 350.13,
          "en": "So if we save that and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 350.13,
          "end": 353.72,
          "en": "if I log out and log in like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 353.72,
          "end": 356.58,
          "en": "we still see the dialogue, so that still works,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 356.58,
          "end": 359.84000000000003,
          "en": "but actually code is only downloaded when it's needed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 359.84000000000003,
          "end": 362.43,
          "en": "and I can prove this to you, log out again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 362.43,
          "end": 365.03,
          "en": "and go to login and reload there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 365.03,
          "end": 367.03,
          "en": "we can open up the dev tools,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 367.03,
          "end": 370.94,
          "en": "ignore the warnings here and go to network.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 370.94,
          "end": 372.49,
          "en": "And now I have to reload again,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 373.86,
          "end": 375.81,
          "en": "you see a couple of files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 375.81,
          "end": 379.09,
          "en": "that were downloaded from our development server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 379.09,
          "end": 382.87,
          "en": "and one file you see here is this 0.js file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 382.87,
          "end": 384.48,
          "en": "maybe it's named differently for you,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 384.48,
          "end": 387.18,
          "en": "but you should see an extra JavaScript file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 387.18,
          "end": 389.9,
          "en": "next to app.js which is your main app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 389.9,
          "end": 393.43,
          "en": "and maybe this chunk-vendors.js file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 393.43,
          "end": 396.71,
          "en": "Now, if I log in, you won't see any changes in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 396.71,
          "end": 399.52,
          "en": "but if I now go to register as coach,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 399.52,
          "end": 403.76,
